license. The following components carry notable obligations:

* SpiffWorkflow (https://github.com/sartography/SpiffWorkflow), used by the
  m8flow-bpmn-core engine, is licensed under the GNU Lesser General Public
  License v3.0 (LGPL-3.0). It is installed as an unmodified, separately
