* bpmn-js and dmn-js (https://bpmn.io), used by m8flow-bpmn and
  m8flow-designer, are licensed under the bpmn.io license, which requires
  the bpmn.io project watermark to stay visible in the rendered diagrams.

* psycopg (https://www.psycopg.org) is licensed under the LGPL-3.0 and is
